{"name":"Sunscreen + vitamin C layering routine","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":37,"casual":{"lead":["The routine is a vitamin C serum followed by a broad-spectrum sunscreen each morning, popular for brighter-looking, better-protected skin and slower visible ageing.","Sunscreen filters absorb or reflect UV, while vitamin C is an antioxidant that scavenges reactive oxygen species. Wikipedia's sunscreen article says antioxidants can interact with UV filters and reduce reactive oxygen species, describing them as a second line of defence behind the filters, though several of those statements are flagged as needing citations. No trial tests the layering routine itself."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["People apply the serum to clean skin in the morning, let it settle, and then apply sunscreen over it as the last step before makeup. It is used daily."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["No specific risks of the pairing were found in the sources consulted; allergic contact dermatitis is documented for some sunscreen ingredients."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[{"title":"Sunscreens part 1: Mechanisms and efficacy.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38772426/","source":"Journal of the American Academy of Dermatology","year":2025,"cites":null,"kind":"Review"},{"title":"Sunscreens part 2: Regulation and safety.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38777185/","source":"Journal of the American Academy of Dermatology","year":2025,"cites":null,"kind":"Review"},{"title":"Management of Acne in Pregnancy.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38453786/","source":"American journal of clinical dermatology","year":2024,"cites":null,"kind":"Review"},{"title":"High-Performance Radiative Cooling Sunscreen.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39546330/","source":"Nano letters","year":2024,"cites":null,"kind":null},{"title":"Dispelling myths about sunscreen.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32633165/","source":"The Journal of dermatological treatment","year":2022,"cites":null,"kind":"Review"},{"title":"Sunscreens and Photoaging: A Review of Current Literature.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34387824/","source":"American journal of clinical dermatology","year":2021,"cites":null,"kind":"Review"},{"title":"Effect of Sunscreen Application on Plasma Concentration of Sunscreen Active Ingredients: A Randomized Clinical Trial.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31961417/","source":"JAMA","year":2020,"cites":null,"kind":"Randomized Controlled Trial"},{"title":"Sunscreen photoprotection and vitamin D status.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31069788/","source":"The British journal of dermatology","year":2019,"cites":null,"kind":"Review"},{"title":"Effect of Sunscreen Application Under Maximal Use Conditions on Plasma Concentration of Sunscreen Active Ingredients: A Randomized Clinical Trial.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31058986/","source":"JAMA","year":2019,"cites":null,"kind":"Clinical Trial, Phase I"},{"title":"Sunscreen and prevention of skin aging: a randomized trial.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23732711/","source":"Annals of internal medicine","year":2013,"cites":null,"kind":"Randomized Controlled Trial"},{"title":"Reduced melanoma after regular sunscreen use: randomized trial follow-up.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21135266/","source":"Journal of clinical oncology : official journal of the American Society of Clinical Oncology","year":2011,"cites":null,"kind":"Randomized Controlled Trial"},{"title":"Skin toxicity evaluation protocol with panitumumab (STEPP), a phase II, open-label, randomized trial evaluating the impact of a pre-Emptive Skin treatment regimen on skin toxicities and quality of life in patients with metastatic colorectal cancer.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/20142600/","source":"Journal of clinical oncology : official journal of the American Society of Clinical Oncology","year":2010,"cites":null,"kind":"Clinical Trial, Phase II"},{"title":"Photoprotection.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15928611/","source":"Journal of the American Academy of Dermatology","year":2005,"cites":null,"kind":"Review"},{"title":"The effect of niacinamide on reducing cutaneous pigmentation and suppression of melanosome transfer.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/12100180/","source":"The British journal of dermatology","year":2002,"cites":null,"kind":"Clinical Trial"}],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Sunscreen Ruins My Face","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/sunscreen-ruins-my-face.514290/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220926000416/https://looksmax.org/threads/sunscreen-ruins-my-face.514290/"},{"title":"Guide Sunscreen, and why should you use","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/sunscreen-and-why-should-you-use.369349/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210704161605/https://looksmax.org/threads/sunscreen-and-why-should-you-use.369349/"},{"title":"Serious Sunscreen recommendations","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/sunscreen-recommendations.307512/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230626074953/https://looksmax.org/threads/sunscreen-recommendations.307512/"},{"title":"sunscreen and prevention of skin aging","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/sunscreen-and-prevention-of-skin-aging.29429/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210713051122/https://looksmax.org/threads/sunscreen-and-prevention-of-skin-aging.29429/"},{"title":"sunscreen harmful","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/sunscreen-harmful.4776/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230202174138/https://looksmax.org/threads/sunscreen-harmful.4776/"},{"title":"bought tinted sunscreen my experience with it","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bought-tinted-sunscreen-my-experience-with-it.1792014/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive